{"id":"int-a477aa4ed11a1d6e570b27fec33cfd10","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-09T17:27:52.527336Z","actor":"Justin Martin","issue_id":"syl-72y","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Already fixed on main before this bead was filed — the agent's worktree branched from af5d6b5, which predates the fix. main installs shutdown handlers BEFORE startSyl with a late-bound close, so there is no window where the service answers health checks while a signal would still kill it. Independent rediscovery is good evidence the bug was real: two of us found it the same afternoon from different directions."}}
{"id":"int-849bc3732370a41e6c171cd8f76efc09","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-09T17:27:54.46635Z","actor":"Justin Martin","issue_id":"syl-bfe","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Same cause, already fixed on main: vitest's 5000ms default is not a valid assumption for a suite that spawns real subprocesses. Raised to 20s (with hookTimeout to match) before this bead was filed; the agent's worktree predates it. Its measurements — 0, 1, 11 and 24 failures on consecutive runs of one commit — are preserved in the merged comment in vitest.shared.ts, because they are better evidence than mine."}}
{"id":"int-093893b6166fa61dc54e86169a163c71","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-09T17:37:23.529749Z","actor":"Justin Martin","issue_id":"syl-vls","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Reviewed and merged (125 files green). Verified against the trap rather than the bead text: the 'what the story does not yet do' block is gone and both of its tests were INVERTED, not deleted — an assistant message does arrive and is persisted, and an HTTP post is broadcast and answered. us2 went 12 tests to 15 and now means what its name says, including 'should answer over a real subprocess, and resume the same session next turn' and 'should answer two quick sends in order, one turn at a time'. Failure is a persisted assistant message rather than silence. Streaming deliberately deferred to syl-aym with the contract reason stated."}}
